  "question": {
    "text": "For&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, the value of&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
